      "comment": "INNER SPARK (1) had a tricky draw last time and although midfield in fifth wasn't far away finishing 4.5 lengths from the winner (19.80). Has placed a couple of times at this track. Has ability and looks hard to stop. CORLESS THE KING (8) has shown good improvement at his last two starts, hitting the frame latest when 3rd at Bulli over 340m. Safe beginner but wide box to overcome and will need some luck. Can measure up. JACOBITE KNIFE (4) missed the frame last time after colliding with another runner in a Grade 5 at Temora, finishing a 4.5 lengths fourth (19.36). Worth following up. LONE RUSTLER (2) should be thereabouts.",
